WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,340 --> 00:00:01,179
Li Mo

2
00:00:01,179 --> 00:00:02,017
hello

3
00:00:02,017 --> 00:00:03,694
I'm Xie Min

4
00:00:03,694 --> 00:00:04,952
congratulations

5
00:00:04,952 --> 00:00:09,146
Not only did he win the title of strong member

6
00:00:09,146 --> 00:00:12,500
He also successfully entered Qingyuan University

7
00:00:12,500 --> 00:00:14,500
Manager Xie’s information is quite good.

8
00:00:14,500 --> 00:00:22,500
In this regard, our mall naturally has relevant channels. According to our previous agreement, if you become a strong member and enter Qingyuan, the endorsement fee will be 15 million, and the silver membership card will be valid for five years.

9
00:00:22,500 --> 00:00:30,340
However, after I reported your results to the company, the situation has changed a little, so I want to discuss it with you first.

10
00:00:30,340 --> 00:00:31,340
What changes?

11
00:00:31,340 --> 00:00:38,340
Our company would like to extend the endorsement period with you. The results of this classmate's exam were so impressive that everyone in the room noticed it.

12
00:00:38,340 --> 00:00:44,340
We predict that in the next few years, it will be difficult for you to produce more top candidates than you, so we want to renew the contract for three years.

13
00:00:44,340 --> 00:00:48,670
What are the specific conditions?

14
00:00:48,670 --> 00:00:55,930
The endorsement fee of 20 million is paid annually, and the silver membership card is extended to ten years. Two advertisements need to be filmed every year, a total of six in three years.
